Error [jet.RecursiveLambda]: A lambda can't call itself as `f`
  --> tests/ui/lambda_self_rec.jet:1:16
    |
  1 | run: fn() { f: fn(x: Int) { f(x) } }
    |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Short functions stored in a binding can't recurse in v1
 Fix: Write a named `fn` instead of assigning the lambda to `f`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0804

Error [jet.UnknownFunction]: Nothing named `f` exists here
  --> tests/ui/lambda_self_rec.jet:1:29
    |
  1 | run: fn() { f: fn(x: Int) { f(x) } }
    |                             ^
 Why: Only functions that have been defined (or built in, like `print` / `panic`) can be called
 Fix: Define it first (fn f() { ... }), or call one that exists
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0102
